# ============================================
# Data folder: raw/third-party data excluded from
# the public repository (tens of GB, mostly external
# raw datasets plus Dagmar's own raw Fraser recordings).
# Only the top-level index and each dataset's own
# citation/access README.md are tracked; INTERNAL_NOTES.md
# files (session-level analysis notes) stay local.
# See docs/TODO_GitHubReleasePrep_v002.md Part D.
# ============================================
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/*/
data/*/*
!data/*/README.md

# ============================================
# Internal working documentation, not for public release.
# Session logs, TODOs, findings reference, paper drafts, and
# every README_*/TODO_* planning doc in docs/ carry internal
# narrative (script names, session dates, internal debugging
# history) not suitable for public airing -- same category of
# problem the data/ READMEs had, applied to the whole folder.
# Root-level README.md/CITATION.cff are separate files, outside
# docs/, and are NOT affected by this rule.
# ============================================
docs/

# ============================================
# tool/ (estimateBetaStar) -- ships as its own separate GitHub
# repo via the stagingForGithub pattern already used for
# fractalnoise/concordance/mantel/monotonicity, not as part of
# this repo. Excluded here, not deleted -- the working copy stays
# in the local Dropbox tree until its own release is staged.
# ============================================
tool/

# ============================================
# JenDiversion/ -- Lei Zhang STAN collaboration side-thread.
# Contains private correspondence (Jen email.rtf) and derived
# Hickman Study 2 participant data (DagJenLei/*.csv), plus a
# 562.69 MB single file (JenTest2.zip, over GitHub's 100MB hard
# limit on its own). No established public/citation purpose for
# this repo -- excluded wholesale, not cherry-picked.
# ============================================
JenDiversion/

